00:06:12.651 --> 00:06:24.938
IRDIA says if you have promised 1000 crores of health insurance

00:06:24.938 --> 00:06:30.650
then you need 1.5 times money than promised

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:38.886
in rare case company will be able to pay health insurance amount to all customers at the same time

00:06:38.886 --> 00:06:46.041
so min 1.5 is needed

00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:48.878
more solvency ratio is good for you

00:06:48.878 --> 00:07:00.985
like star health have ratio of 2 means you will get settlement easily in case of any extremes like covid pandemic

00:07:00.985 --> 00:07:09.330
